g=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">捆绑；束缚；系紧；限制；约束；束缚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199617\">どろぼうは<ruby>手足<rp>(</rp><rt>てあし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>縛<rp>(</rp><rt>しば</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>られた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The thief was bound hand and foot.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しびれる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">麻木；发麻（如四肢）；触电；（因触电而）刺痛；麻刺；兴奋；激动；着迷；被迷住</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"189908\"><ruby>右手<rp>(</rp><rt>みぎて</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしびれます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">My right hand is numb.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">紙幣</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しへい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">纸币；纸钞；钞票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"151195\"><ruby>紙幣<rp>(</rp><rt>しへい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>合計<rp>(</rp><rt>ごうけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>５０<ruby>枚<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The bill amounts to fifty dollars.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しぼむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">（花、梦想等）凋谢；枯萎；下垂；皱缩；褪色；松垮；泄气</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lan