>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはその<ruby>話<rp>(</rp><rt>はなし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしみじみ<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じられた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The story came home to her.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">氏名</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">姓名；身份</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219970\">この<ruby>封筒<rp>(</rp><rt>ふうとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>住所<rp>(</rp><rt>じゅうしょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>・<ruby>氏名<rp>(</rp><rt>しめい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>書<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Write your name and address on this envelope.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">締切</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめきり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">截止期限；截止时间；截稿时间；关闭；闭合；围堰；防水堤</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"228707\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はいつも<ruby>締<rp>(</rp><rt>し</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>め<ruby>切<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りを<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I always keep my deadlines.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">締め切る</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しめきる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></s