"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">社会科学</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"208250\">その<ruby>大学<rp>(</rp><rt>だいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>課程<rp>(</rp><rt>かてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>自然科学<rp>(</rp><rt>しぜんかがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と<ruby>社会科学<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃかいかがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>成<rp>(</rp><rt>な</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>立<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">That university&#x27;s curriculum covers natural science and social science.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">しゃがむ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">蹲；蹲下；蹲着</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146770\"><ruby>少<rp>(</rp><rt>すこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>し<ruby>離<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れて<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ると、その<ruby>岩<rp>(</rp><rt>いわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がしゃがんだ<ruby>姿<rp>(</rp><rt>すがた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Seen at a distance, the rock looks like a squatting human figure.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">車庫</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">しゃこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">车库；车棚；（火车、公共汽车等的）车辆段；库棚；电车库</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"104645\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>車<rp>(</rp><rt>くるま